{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find & grab object; if found, move, take, check properties & perform task. Otherwise, explore area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaScanned    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
